  "hash": 1563930741,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Grants an Additional Melee Charge.\n\nUsing your Charged Melee Ability while sliding performs a <stasis/>Stasis Uppercut, dealing damage and <stasis/><pve freezing /> <pvp [slowing] /> targets within ? meters of the attack. \n\nHowl of The Storm instantly spawns two lines of <stasis/>Stasis Crystals in a (V) Formation in front of you. Each line is comprised of one small, two medium, then one large <stasis/>Stasis Crystal.\n\nSpawned <stasis/>Crystals are considered Powered Melees and inherent damage boosts, melee effects, and Exotic benefits.\n\nThis attack can also be used during <stasis/>Glacial Quake at the cost of 15% Super Energy per Uppercut.\n\nFiring your weapon during the slide disables this ability.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T20:47:58.108Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
